      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nI accidentally posted a reply instead of a regular comment and left it as is; I apologize.\n\nI’ll skip the details of my reply since they’re the same as in the comment, but I’m adding this update because there’s been a change in the situation.\n\nJust a moment ago, the looping issue in the social feed occurred again, and I discovered that I couldn’t switch instances. The “Return to Home” button didn’t respond, nor did any of the other navigation buttons, so I decided to restart the game.\n\nAfter restarting, I was unable to log in.\n\nI can’t log in even after restarting my computer.\n\nAdditionally, in this state, even if I close the app via Steam, it continues to run and can only be terminated via Task Manager.\n\nWith the loop, inability to navigate, and now inability to log in, I have to say this is simply too much. I request immediate action.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
