      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nI’m sorry—the issue with being unable to log in was actually a server problem. It was my mistake. I truly apologize.\n\nHowever, while I was working on this, I remembered that a similar issue occurred during the last looping incident, but at that time, there didn’t seem to be any problem with the server.\n\nIt’s possible that a different issue could cause something similar to happen, but since I don’t know yet whether this is a coincidence or if it’s being triggered, and I can’t verify it, I’ll just mention it here.",
